        there she was. \rShe was not the usual type of woman who would drink here.
        For a start both her eyes pointed in the right direction, and she still had
        all of her teeth.\r ","lineID":-1,"multiLineIDs":[],"isBackground":false,"noAnimation":true,"headClip":{"instanceID":0},"mouthClip":{"instanceID":0},"play2DHeadAnim":false,"headClip2D":"","headLayer":0,"play2DMouthAnim":false,"mouthClip2D":"","mouthLayer":0,"waitTimeOffset":2.0}'
